            Get Started
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-text-secondary italic">
          Trusted by modern hotels to simplify operations and delight guests at scale.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Problem → Solution Section -->
