              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-text-primary mb-1">Upsell opportunities are missed</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-neutral-text-secondary leading-normal">Upgrades and services are never offered at the right moment.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-x-6">
