              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Automate guest communication 24/7</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-normal">Instant AI-powered replies on WhatsApp for every inquiry.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-x-6">
              <div class="flex-none mt-1 w-6 h-6 text-[#d9c5a0]">
                <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Engage guests before, during, and after stay</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-normal">Personalized touchpoints that make guests feel valued.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-x-6">
              <div class="flex-none mt-1 w-6 h-6 text-[#d9c5a0]">
                <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Increase revenue through smart upsells</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-normal">Auto-offer upgrades and services at the perfect moment.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-x-6">
              <div class="flex-none mt-1 w-6 h-6 text-[#d9c5a0]">
                <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Own your guest relationships</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-normal">Build a direct database for loyalty and repeat bookings.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
